# Top-level packages for the document MCP servers on macOS (Apple Silicon).
# PDF runs as on Windows. Excel/PPT/Word use LibreOffice (installed separately,
# no Python package); HWP/HWPX uses python-hwpx instead of Hancom COM
# (docs/설계-macOS.md M6).
# Resolve only for CPython 3.12 on macOS arm64, then install from the soul wheelhouse.
# Shared versions are constrained to the Windows lock (../document-mcp/requirements.lock).
